<h2><span style="font-size: 24px;">Current Adopted Codes &amp; Design Criteria</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><a rel="noopener" href="https://www.nfpa.org/codes-and-standards/nfpa-70-standard-development/70" target="_blank">2023 National Electric Code</a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IRC2021P2" target="_blank">2021 International Residential Code</a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IBC2021P2" target="_blank">2021 International Building Code</a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IFC2021P2" target="_blank">2021 International Fire Code</a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IPC2021P3" target="_blank">2021 International Plumbing Code</a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IMC2021P3" target="_blank">2021 International Mechanical Code</a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IFGC2021P2" target="_blank">2021 International Fuel Gas Code</a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IECC2021P2" target="_blank">2021 International Energy Conservation Code</a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IEBC2021P2" target="_blank">2021 International Existing Building Code</a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/icca117-12017P4" target="_blank">2017 ICC A117.1 Accessible and Usable Buildings and Facilities</a></li>
<li><a href= "Documents/Departments/Building Department/Adopted Codes & Design Criteria/2025ColoradoWildfireResiliencyCode (1).pdf?t=202606021135430" rel="noopener"  target="_blank"  >2025 Colorado Wildfire Resiliency Code </a>&nbsp;<span style="color: #e03e2d;"><strong> <a href="https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/34c113129c044004bc672ca5493378de" target="_blank">2025 Colorado Wildfire Resiliency Code State Map</a></strong></span></li>
<li><a href= "Documents/Departments/Building Department/Adopted Codes & Design Criteria/77810.pdf?t=202503011444010" rel="noopener"  target="_blank"  >2021 International Building Codes</a> (Ordinance 2023-02) Amendments to All Codes Adopted</li>
</ul>
<br /><br /><br />
<ul>
<li><a href= "Documents/Departments/Building Department/Adopted Codes & Design Criteria/2026-02 Ordinance Adopting the CWRC with Local Amendments_RECORDED.pdf?t=202606021136110"  target="_blank"  >2025 BOCC Ordinance 2026-02 </a>&nbsp;Colorado Wildfire Resiliency Code with Local Amendments</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li><a href= "Documents/Departments/Building Department/Adopted Codes & Design Criteria/Regulation 43-2025.pdf?t=202603311653050"  target="_blank"  >2025 OWTS Regulations</a>&nbsp;</li>
<li><a href= "Documents/Departments/Building Department/Adopted Codes & Design Criteria/2025-03 BOH Chaffee County OWTS Regs 43 2025.pdf?t=202603231356260" rel="noopener"  target="_blank"  >BOH Resolutions 2025-03 </a>&nbsp;OWTS Regulations and Amendments adopted by Chaffee County</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li><a href= "Documents/Departments/Building Department/Adopted Codes & Design Criteria/2025-04 BOH Graywater Control Regulations.pdf?t=202602261429140"  target="_blank"  >BOH Resolution 2025-04</a> Chaffee County Graywater Control Regulations</li>
<li><a href= "2026-01 Ordinance Chaffee County Electric Preferred Amendments_RECORDED.pdf?t=202608031134050"  target="_blank"  >2026 BOCC Ordinance 2026-01</a>&nbsp; Chaffee County Electric Preferred Amendments</li>
</ul>
<br />
<ul>
<li><a href= "Documents/Departments/Building Department/Adopted Codes & Design Criteria/77565.pdf?t=202503011445180"  target="_blank"  >Colorado Model Electric Ready &amp; Solar Ready Code</a></li>
<li><a href= "Documents/Departments/Building Department/Adopted Codes & Design Criteria/77357.pdf?t=202503011445370"  target="_blank"  >Colorado Model Electric and Solar Ready Code Explanatory Notes</a></li>
<li><a href= "Documents/Departments/Building Department/Adopted Codes & Design Criteria/77358.pdf?t=202503011447590"  target="_blank"  >Colorado Model Code and Solar Ready Code Process Overview &amp; Explanatory Notes</a><br /><br /><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;"><br />Local Amendments to the Codes</span></strong></li>
</ul>
Ground Snow Load - See <a href= "Documents/Departments/Building Department/Adopted Codes & Design Criteria/71228.pdf?t=202502281257390"  target="_blank"  >Snow Load Map</a><br />Wind Speed - 115 mph Vult.<br />Seismic Design Category - C<br />Frost Depth - See <a href= "Documents/Departments/Building Department/Adopted Codes & Design Criteria/64215.pdf?t=202502281257380"  target="_blank"  >Minimum Footing &amp; Foundation Requirements</a><br />Winter Design Temp &nbsp;-10&deg; F<br /><br /><br /><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;"><a rel="noopener" href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTLU6SnkrgUmDUb2f2pDqIqqeY0AGGEI2" target="_blank">2026 Energy Code Workshop Recordings</a></span></strong><br /><br />
<p><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Information on 2021 International Energy Conservation Codes (IECC)</strong></span></p>
<p><a href= "Documents/Departments/Building Department/Adopted Codes & Design Criteria/77358.pdf?t=202503011447590"  target="_blank"  >Colorado Energy Office&rsquo;s code adoption toolkit</a></p>
<p><strong>For additional assistance, the Colorado Energy Office has a Helpline to which questions can be submitted for free. See</strong> <a rel="noopener" href="https://socgov27.my.site.com/COCodesHelpline/s/" target="_blank">https://socgov27.my.site.com/COCodesHelpline/s/</a></p>
<br /><a href="https://coloradocodes.happyfox.com/new" target="_blank"><img src="Images/Departments/Building Department/Adopted Codes & Design Criteria/77124.png?t=202502281257390" alt="77124" width="499" height="193" /></a><br /><br />If you have any questions about Chaffee&rsquo;s code adoption, please email <a rel="noopener" href="mailto:bdepartment@chaffeecounty.org" target="_blank">bdepartment@chaffeecounty.org</a>


